-
-Although OpenSCENARIO XML https://publications.pages.asam.net/standards/ASAM_OpenSCENARIO/ASAM_OpenSCENARIO_XML/latest/06_general_concepts/06_03_coordinate_systems.html#_vehicle_coordinate_system_xv_yv_zv[specifies] the reference point of vehicles to be at rear axle, esmini, from v2.56.0, supports offsetting the reference point along vehicle x-axis.
